# Publish game changes

After a requested change to the game is done, publish it. Do not wait for a separate "publish" message.

## GitHub Pages

Pages serves `main` at https://pfaustino.github.io/bullet-hell/

- Bump `package.json` version.
- Commit the change (never `.env`, keys, `auth`, or `auth-wal`).
- Push `main` and tag `vX.Y.Z`.

## itch.io

- `npm run build -- --base=./`
- Copy `game_v3.js`, `dev/DevPanel.js`, and `audio/` into `dist/` (Vite does not bundle those plain scripts).
- `butler push dist pfaustino/bullet-hell:html5 --userversion <package.json version>`
- Confirm the html5 channel version, then confirm the Pages build is `built` and the live `game_v3.js` contains the change.
